# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deployable SMTP env template (placeholders ONLY — never commit real secrets)
# Copy into .env.production / worker env and fill with your provider values.
# Until SMTP_HOST is reachable from the worker container, email remains 阻塞.
# In-app NotificationEvent still records ticks / tickets_found regardless.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Required to leave Mailhog/local defaults
SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_FROM="Ticket Grab <noreply@example.com>"

# Optional auth (omit both for unauthenticated relay / Mailhog)
SMTP_USER=your-smtp-username
SMTP_PASS=your-smtp-password

# Notes
# - Worker uses nodemailer (apps/worker/src/mail.ts).
# - STARTTLS on 587 is typical; set secure provider options in code if you need 465.
# - Live acceptance 2026-09-22 observed: SMTP send failed ECONNREFUSED 127.0.0.1:587
#   (SMTP_PORT was set but SMTP_HOST pointed at unreachable localhost inside container).
# - Do NOT put real credentials in git, screenshots, or public docs.
